msgstr "*SiteID* และ *Password* เป็นข้อมูลรับรองที่แตกต่างจากที่ใช้ในการเข้าสู่ระบบบัญชี DHL"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:56
msgid "With DHL Express Account"
msgstr "มีบัญชี DHL Express"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:58
msgid ""
"If a DHL Express account is available, log in to the `DHL Developer portal "
"<https://developer.dhl.com/api-reference/dhl-express-mydhl-api#get-started-"
"section/ user-guide%get-access>`_ and `request a DHL API account number "
"<https://developer.dhl. com/form/dhl-express-onboarding>`_."
msgstr ""
"หากมีบัญชี DHL Express ให้เข้าสู่ระบบ `พอร์ทัลสำหรับนักพัฒนาของ DHL <https://"
"developer.dhl.com/api-reference/dhl-express-mydhl-api#get-started-section/ "
"user-guide%get-access>`_ และ `ขอหมายเลขบัญชี DHL API <https://developer.dhl. "
"com/form/dhl-express-onboarding>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:63
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:85
msgid ""
"Then, in Odoo, on the shipping method form, enter the *DHL API Key* in "
