"one or more customers' requested :guilabel:`Product` "
"and :guilabel:`Quantity`. Confirm the quotations, turning them into |SOs|. "
"This generates a delivery order for each |SO|, accessible via the :icon:`fa-"
"truck` :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button."
