#~ msgid ""
#~ "By default, Odoo uses a periodic inventory valuation (also known as "
#~ "manual inventory valuation). This method implies that the accounting team "
#~ "manually posts journal entries, based on the physical inventory of the "
#~ "company, and warehouse employees take the time to count the stock. In "
#~ "Odoo, each product category reflects this, with the :guilabel:`Costing "
#~ "Method` set to :guilabel:`Standard Price`, and the :guilabel:`Inventory "
#~ "Valuation` (not visible by default) set to :guilabel:`Manual`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "ตามค่าเริ่มต้น Odoo จะใช้การประเมินมูลค่าสินค้าคงคลังเป็นระยะ "
